  <li id="thy-r6"><span class="rf-for">弦の損失の式の形、統計的なモード（統計的なギター）</span><span class="rf-src">J. Woodhouse, “On the synthesis of guitar plucks,” <i>Acta Acustica united with Acustica</i>, vol. 90, pp. 928–944, 2004</span></li>
